});
```
2. **Use a connection pooling strategy**: EF Core provides a `ConnectionPoolStrategy` class that can be used to control the connection pooling behavior. You can implement a custom strategy to handle connection throttling, error handling, and other pooling-related tasks.
```csharp
public class MyConnectionPoolStrategy : ConnectionPoolStrategy
{
    public override Task<DbConnection> GetConnectionAsync(CancellationToken cancellationToken)
    {
        // Implement your custom connection pooling logic here
    }
}

options.UseSqlServer(connectionString, providerOptions =>
